# Kaynos Docs core

Static documentation site for `docs.kaynos.net`. Netlify publish root is `.` (no build step). Primary artifacts: `index.html` (~340KB single file), `feed.xml`, `sitemap.xml`, `robots.txt`. Sibling repos: `kaynos` (product), `kaynos-site` (marketing) — keep URLs/naming consistent across them.

## Rules

- **`index.html` is huge — make surgical edits.** Never wholesale-reformat generated HTML; noisy diffs obscure review and break merges.
- Read a file before editing. Do what was asked; avoid scope creep.
- Credentials-free repo. No secrets, ever. Keep scratch notes out of the published root.
- Default branch is **`main`** (not `master`).
- **Tracker is Linear (`KAY-` prefix)** — authoritative here, overrides any global Jira/`CX-` default. Branch `<type>/KAY-<n>-<desc>`, commit `<type>: <desc> [KAY-<n>]`. See `linear-cli`.

## Auto-merge (this repo only)

After opening a PR here, auto-merge it — the user has said they don't want to be the merge button:

```bash
gh pr merge <N> --squash --auto --delete-branch
```

Don't ask, don't wait. Green CI → squash-merges and Netlify ships `docs.kaynos.net`. Failing CI → it waits for your fix. **This default is specific to `kaynos-docs`**; `kaynos` and `kaynos-site` keep standard review.

## Verify

Playwright specs in `tests/` (`playwright.config.js` baseURL targets production). Run `npm install` then `npm test`; override `baseURL` for local/staging so you don't only assert against prod.
